- Improved accessibility and micro-interactions.
- Reviewed the application like a Senior Product Designer and Software Engineer.

## Testing
- Verified every existing feature after refinement.
- Tested responsive layouts.
- Checked accessibility improvements.
- Confirmed the deployed application still works correctly.

## Documentation
